<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Enersul 1996 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Enersul 1996 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mato Grosso do Sul state power company Enersul, expected to be privatized in November, issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>		  1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr loss    3.08 reais     Profit 0.54 reais</p>
<p>    Loss	  114.3 million	Profit 20.1 million</p>
<p>    Net revs    173.9 million		 152.2 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share figures provided per lot of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>Mato Grosso do Sul state said it plans to hire consultants to assess the company and draw up a privatization model for the firm on May 5.</p>
<p>In September, the state plans to release tender documents to sell Enersul, it added.</p>
<p>((-- Romina Nicaretta, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248 5415))</p>
</text>
